    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/9c3575eb3a4c54e09ccc4d4f19886517.avif?t=1752130305\" width=616 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Cyclics still in Early Access, only core gameplay are not likely to change a lot but other aspect may subject to change.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/69e8073c5644b39fae9dc44cf79de0dd.webp?t=1752130305\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyclics</strong> is a <strong>4-Keys Rhythm Game</strong> mixed with <strong>Catch The Beat</strong> in a circular playing field. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the notes with your keyboard's keys and Block the notes with your mouse movement! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your left right hand coordination and your rhythmic sense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/39b5a3cd2325c2b6315728957bbe9632.poster.avif?t=1752130305\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/39b5a3cd2325c2b6315728957bbe9632.webm?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/39b5a3cd2325c2b6315728957bbe9632.mp4?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic Input </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/ab64aec02301f56fc833d8e55b5cae59.poster.avif?t=1752130305\" width=332 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/ab64aec02301f56fc833d8e55b5cae59.webm?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/ab64aec02301f56fc833d8e55b5cae59.mp4?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>W/A/S/D or Arrow keys for [Tap/Hold/Release Note]</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/5450b846c16df414e3bbfbe225af0086.poster.avif?t=1752130305\" width=332 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/5450b846c16df414e3bbfbe225af0086.webm?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/5450b846c16df414e3bbfbe225af0086.mp4?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Spacebar or WASD for [Star Note]</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/afa9acc39d52ab73ab016474b54ae28f.poster.avif?t=1752130305\" width=332 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/afa9acc39d52ab73ab016474b54ae28f.webm?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959160/extras/afa9acc39d52ab73ab016474b54ae28f.mp4?t=1752130305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p cl